    "Open annotated Ghidra supplies complete typed pseudocode and exact106 pinned instructions; REA own raw Program is not assumed to inherit GUI metadata. Compiled C call graph closes over6 actual C functions and confirms the late mode gate. Existing IEEE raise body remains byte-identical.",
    "Scope is defined logical/memory/FP behavior for original valid producer state; physical unused arguments/registers/flags and arbitrary handler equivalence are not claimed."
